Serial Number is listed Benson Amps - Germanium Fuzz - Studio Black SOLD - Contact us for more options Free Shipping Eligible The Benson Amps - Germanium Fuzz - Studio Black is the first fuzz pedal with automatic thermal bias technology. The regulated circuitry automatically and gently warms the germanium transistors in order to ensure a consistent tone, no matter the temperature conditions. The pedal takes around 2-3 minutes to warm up and sound correct, with the LED light actually changing colors to indicate it's ready to go. At the heart of the Benson Studio Black Fuzz is a couple of germanium transistors that have been graded and matched to deliver the best fuzz possible. The tone of this pedal is versatile and dynamic, reminiscent of '60s Fuzzface sounds, allowing you to clean up your tone by rolling off the volume knob on your guitar. The Gain and Impedance settings puts overdrive, clean boost, dark or light fuzz and full-on zip at your fingertips. This Studio Black version is designed for indoor use and should not be in direct sunlight when in use. For outdoor gigs check out the Solar White version. It's very important that this pedal be run with a high-quality and consistent power supply, please ask us if you have questions. Browse More Benson Pedals Browse All Pedals Need More Info? Your Name: Email: Message: Free Set Ups We take the time to set up every new guitar, mando, bass, uke, or banjo for every player, whether it was purchased here in Lawrence, Kansas or on our website. Large retailers are content to ship you a guitar right off of the warehouse shelf, while we take pride in the fact that your new instrument will be set up to be truly ready to play - for you. Contact Us! Call us at 800-747-9980 or send us an email at info@massstreetmusic.com - we're here to help! All of us at Mass Street Music are musicians, and we're dedicated to helping you find exactly what you're looking for. You can also check out our Staff Page if you'd like to email one of us 